# Read by Cloudflare Pages and Netlify. **GitHub Pages ignores this file** —
# it has no redirect mechanism at all. That is why the generated /index.html
# carries a meta refresh to the same place, and why it must stay there.

# Amharic is the default, because the language is (SITE.md §3).
#
# 302, not 301: a permanent redirect is cached by browsers more or less
# forever, and the default language is a decision that could reasonably change
# — to content negotiation, or to a chooser. A wrong 301 is very hard to take
# back from someone who has already visited.
/   /am/   302

# v1 lived at code.ahadu.com and its links are in the wild.
/playground/index.html   /playground/   301
